Subject: [PATCH] d3d9: interpolate wrapped coordinates across the seam

For each line or triangle, lift selected texture-coordinate components
across the largest gap on the unit circle before rasterization. Fold the
interpolated coordinates back before the pixel shader consumes them.

Read WRAP0 through WRAP15 from the render state table at draw time so
state-block replay takes the same path as direct setters.

---
